uestra de biopsia de tejido mamario, de 2x2x1 cm, de color blanco, consistencia firme, bordes irregulares, sin lesiones visibles a simple vista</td><td>Final</td><td>2021-06-01 12:00:00-0400</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"Observation-r2bo-estadificacion-tnm-ex.html\"><span title=\"Codes:{http://snomed.info/sct 399588009}\">Pathologic TNM stage grouping</span></a></td><td/><td>Final</td><td>2021-06-01 12:00:00-0400</td></tr></table><p>Carcinoma ductal infiltrante de mama, grado histológico 2, estadio pT2N2M1, con márgenes quirúrgicos positivos y con evidencia de necrosis tumoral</p><p><b>Coded Conclusions:</b></p><ul><li><span title=\"Codes:{http://snomed.info/sct 82711006}, {http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/icd-o-3 8500/3}\">Carcinoma ductal infiltrante</span></li><li><span title=\"Codes:{http://snomed.info/sct 76752008}, {http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/icd-o-3 C50.9}\">Mama</span></li></ul></div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral ]
